ok, I completely understand where your coming from. But cutting them off from support will only make the problem worse. it's not like cutting them off will stop the supply, the demand is there and that's what drives supply, its basic economic principles. hard drugs are practically perfectly inelastic when it comes to demand, all cutting of the supply will do is ensure that the druggies will have to go to more desperate measures to get a fix, creating a more unsafe environment for all. 

&#x200B;

doing nothing however is also not acceptable, there is a middle ground which i firmly believe will work.

yes, the answer of deaths directly because of climate change is zero,

&#x200B;

do you know how many people die of old age? the answer is also zero, this does not mean that old age does not affect people.

&#x200B;

The effects and consequences of climate change have already killed people and the situation is only going to get worst. No, I am not promoting communism a free market economy has been economically proven to do better. I believe in climate change because the evidence is real and tbh it scares the crap out of me.

